-- טבלאות השכר וטבלאות ההמרה למורים, מעודכנות החל מיום 1.1.2015 (נספחים
-- א'1–א'7): the seven teachers' tables of the reform as they stand from
-- 1.1.2015 — the salary tables of a first (BA, rating code 101) and a
-- second degree (MA, 102), the same two with the intermediate grades for
-- the conversion only, and the conversion tables of the non-academic
-- teachers of the three ranks (בכיר 104, מוסמך 105, בלתי מוסמך 106). The
-- corpus publishes them as one document; no agreement in the corpus
-- annexes them.
--
-- What produces them: the framework agreement's last allocation, due from
-- 1.7.2013 under §155(א) of the base agreement at the rate §92(ג) of the
-- completion agreement of 29.2.2012 set — the tables 6.35% above those in
-- force before the update of 1.1.2011 — which the agreement of 22.7.2013
-- put off to 1.1.2015 (both imported). Until then the tables stood 5.75%
-- above the same tables, as the third part of the 2011 framework
-- (15.4.2013, imported) annexes them. The corpus does not hold the tables
-- before 1.1.2011, so each cell is set beside the third part's cell at the
-- same seniority and grade, raised by 1.0635/1.0575.
--
-- The tables are DATA, cell for cell as the corpus publishes them, in the
-- tables collection's types (`tables-common`). The checks below run over
-- every cell: the update of 1.1.2015, the salary tables against their
-- conversion tables (§46(א)), the steps each table prints, and the
-- intermediate grades.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `tables-common`
IMPORT `2013-04-15_ofek-hadash_tosefet-2011-third-part_tables`
IMPORT `2013-07-22_ofek-hadash_last-phase-deferral`

§ `טבלאות השכר וטבלאות ההמרה למורים — 1.1.2015 (נספחים א'1–א'7)`

-- akn:attachments The heading over the seven annexes; a label row with no text of its own.

-- Every table prints under it "טבלה מעודכנת החל מיום 1.1.2015": the day
-- the agreement of 22.7.2013 put the last allocation off to (asserted
-- below).
